WEBVTT

00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:16,380
With my diagnosis, is it safe for me to use collagen? I struggle with dry skin air and brittle nails

00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:22,780
Well, I do ox also have a blog post on collagen and that

