Though there's conflicting research with collagen and cancer

00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:37,780
The there there was research back about 20 years ago say that collagen can be beneficial with cancer

00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:43,480
And then there's newer research that says collagen can actually drive cancer

00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:47,780
So when you have conflicting research with something like that that

00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:51,280
There may be you know that you can kind of

00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:57,080
Understand that there is not a lot of bias in those in those articles

00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:06,480
You have to think that I typically fall on the side of I wouldn't use collagen if my cancer was really active

00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:12,480
So if my cancer was not active and I was in a state of relative remission

00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:16,480
I don't think there's anything wrong with using collagen now don't

00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,480
confuse

00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:20,480
Collagen with colostrum

